    "items": [
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186379818?u=4fa416d9a926677b033c0b52ba207d6cf7cd7920&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Clarifies the <code class=\"notranslate\">NotAllowedError</code> exception of <code class=\"notranslate\">PeriodicSyncManager.register()</code>: the required permission is <code class=\"notranslate\">periodic-background-sync</code>, and in Chromium-based browsers it is only granted to sites installed as an app (PWA).</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The register() page now explains how and when the permission needed for periodic background sync is granted.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #33692.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2307749697\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/33692\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/33692/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/33692\">#33692</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45230",
            "title": "Document the periodic-background-sync permission for PeriodicSyncManager.register()",
            "date_modified": "2026-08-18T20:37:22.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-08-18T20:36:55.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "NssIs",
                "url": "https://github.com/NssIs"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186379818?u=4fa416d9a926677b033c0b52ba207d6cf7cd7920&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Setting the <code class=\"notranslate\">src</code> property of an <code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLImageElement</code> starts loading the image immediately, even if the element has not yet been added to the document. This sentence is now included in the <code class=\"notranslate\">src</code> property description.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Make the timing of the image request explicit for readers, matching how the property actually behaves.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #26560.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1694492761\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/26560\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/26560/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/26560\">#26560</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45229",
