        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191840740?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #45226.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5183830279\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45226\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45226/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45226\">#45226</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR fixes a typo in the UI pseudo-classes documentation. The text incorrectly says \"generated content on the label\" but the <code class=\"notranslate\">::before</code> pseudo-element is applied to the input element, not the label.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The change corrects \"label\" to \"input\" on line 1234 of <code class=\"notranslate\">files/en-us/learn_web_development/extensions/forms/ui_pseudo-classes/index.md</code>.</p>",
